  "title": "AECOM selected to help advance major rail transportation project in Australia, The Wave – Stage 1",
  "summary": "DALLAS (July 13, 2026) — AECOM (NYSE: ACM), the trusted global infrastructure leader, today announced it has been selected as Independent Certifier for the design and construction of The Wave – Stage 1, with joint venture partner Bureau Veritas. As Queensland’s next major rail project, The Wave will enhance regional connectivity, reduce road congestion, improve...",
